			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "50a58888-e91f-458f-8c3c-5d0d39942d9a")
	)
	(text "CN1: CENTER panel (RVT70H 1024x600) - RiBus 20P FPC"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 389.89 121.92 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.9398 0.9398)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "79849649-6967-4d9b-a434-c70373828cd7")
	)
	(text "Telltale chain, all on-board: +5V -> LED anode; LED cathode -> series resistor -> U10 output, which sinks to GND when the H755 drives the matching input HIGH.\nTT1 LED1 GREEN (left turn) R25 390R | TT2 LED3 WHITE (headlight) R27 300R | TT3 LED4 BLUE (high beam) R39 200R | TT4 LED2 GREEN (right turn) R26 390R\nTT5 LED5 ORANGE (MIL/CEL) R40 470R | TT6 LED6 RED (parking brake) R44 270R | TT7 LED7 RED (oil pressure) R48 270R | TT8 LED8 YELLOW (fog lights) R38 300R\nDriver U10 = TBD62083AFWG DMOS array, ~5 mV on-state drop. The resistor values above predate that swap and are still to be re-derived for it; until then the row runs brighter and unmatched."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 222.25 249.174 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.9398 0.9398)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "85293887-76be-4041-8167-f52a24417bd1")
	)
	(text "J3/J4: CAN termination jumpers - leave OPEN by default (vehicle bus is already terminated). Close only for bench-only bus tests."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 222.25 280.67 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.9398 0.9398)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9501441f-59f4-44a6-972b-4f6350b2f18a")
	)
	(text "CN4/CN5: Waveshare SN65HVD230 CAN breakout modules (7-pin: VCC,GND,TXD,RXD,CANH,CANL,RS). RS tied GND for auto high-speed mode. Verify pin order against physical board silkscreen."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 201.93 271.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.9398 0.9398)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ac0a6c16-10c5-403e-bb25-4032b2f85e3e")
	)
